# AWS Terraform CI/CD Project

Infrastructure as Code (IaC) project using Terraform to provision AWS resources with automated CI/CD pipeline using GitHub Actions.

## Tech Stack
- AWS
- Terraform
- GitHub Actions
- Ubuntu EC2

## Features
- Automated Terraform validation
- Terraform plan execution
- Auto deployment using Terraform Apply
- Secure AWS authentication using GitHub Secrets
- CI/CD pipeline integration

## Project Structure
terraform-project/
├── .github/workflows/terraform.yaml
├── main.tf
├── provider.tf
├── variables.tf
├── outputs.tf
├── backend.tf
├── .gitignore
└── README.md

## Workflow
GitHub Actions pipeline automatically performs:
1. Terraform Init
2. Terraform Format Check
3. Terraform Validate
4. Terraform Plan
5. Terraform Apply

## Security
AWS credentials are securely managed using GitHub Secrets.

